#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:89 7cfe103d8cb44043a812d93718a26bb9
msgid "Read raw data files"
msgstr "读取原始数据文件"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:91 e48329fc21e54c57905979ac0156c7ef
msgid "Read a single file"
msgstr "读取单个文件"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:93 ff06dc81d5ed430dbcf8ff6705b5d064
msgid "To read a raw data file, use `pybes3.open_raw`:"
msgstr "读取原始数据文件使用 `pybes3.open_raw`："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:103 52f510637a7348eaa12a52bb743c2357
msgid "Get meta information:"
msgstr "获取元信息："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:116 100cd808aa1d4fe78f498de851533471
msgid "To read all data:"
msgstr "读取全部数据："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:128 86cf056a69ae4e58bb54fe455aacfb7a
msgid "To read a portion of the file:"
msgstr "读取文件的一部分："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:137 be6916f06ab94e338f8d6d239c230606
msgid ""
"Reading a portion of a file still has to scan the events before "
"`entry_start`. On a Lustre-backed 2 GB file this costs about 1.5 s per "
"long prefix, while reading the events themselves stays at the sequential "
"bandwidth. Opening a file never scans it: the entry offsets are built "
"lazily while reading and kept in the open reader, so later reads through "
"the same object do not scan again."
msgstr ""
"读取文件的一部分仍然需要扫描 `entry_start` 之前的事件。在 Lustre 上的 2 GB 文件中，一段较长的前缀大约耗时 1.5 "
"s，而事件本身的读取速度仍保持顺序带宽。打开文件时不会扫描：entry 偏移在读取过程中懒构建，并保留在已打开的 reader "
"中，因此同一个对象的后续读取不会重复扫描。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:140 0c57080d676c4890b9a12d46f643bdbd
msgid "To read only specific fields:"
msgstr "只读取指定字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:149 d9c63ec7af444c6f8110f66d955f0b5d
msgid "Available fields are: `cgem`, `mdc`, `tof`, `emc`, `muc`, `trigGTD`."
msgstr "可用字段为：`cgem`、`mdc`、`tof`、`emc`、`muc`、`trigGTD`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:151 92ef785efa9e44f0a21caf3e49242ff1
msgid "`evt_header` is always read and cannot be filtered out."
msgstr "`evt_header` 总会被读取，无法过滤掉。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:154 116597fbf9a642308c3d3c5ace07f919
msgid "Iterate over entries"
msgstr "分批遍历事件"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:156 574e63b08be244cf9618bc3227ec1121
msgid "For files that do not fit in memory, read them in batches with `iterate`:"
msgstr "对于无法全部放入内存的文件，可用 `iterate` 分批读取："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:163 2f076c520c0b44e4bab7e83d08b25309
msgid ""
"Each batch is an independent `ak.Array`. `entry_start` and `entry_stop` "
"work as in `arrays`, and `report=True` yields `(start, stop, array)` "
"tuples:"
msgstr ""
"每一批都是一个独立的 `ak.Array`。`entry_start` 与 `entry_stop` 的用法与 `arrays` "
"相同；`report=True` 时会产出 `(start, stop, array)` 元组："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:170 aeab4ca72a5b4fb791d84b7a57f776d0
msgid ""
"Batches are read with a single sequential pass over the same open file "
"handle, so iterating is as fast as reading the file at once and only "
"holds one batch in memory."
msgstr "各批次通过同一个已打开的文件句柄顺序读取，因此分批遍历与一次性读取同样快，并且内存中只保留一批数据。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:172 0ec8819e10e1485b8c191df789a5543a
msgid "Entry offsets"
msgstr "entry 偏移"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:174 d87c4728f50b47edb23c5492c302d10f
msgid ""
"The raw format stores the number of entries but not their offsets, so a "
"partial read scans the preceding events once. `entry_byte_offsets` "
"exposes that scan and keeps the result in the reader:"
msgstr ""
"raw 格式只记录事件总数而不记录偏移，因此部分读取需要先扫描前面的事件。`entry_byte_offsets` "
"会显式触发这次扫描，并把结果保留在 reader 中："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:181 bafd68a3682f4fb0b32a008e97b2e935
msgid ""
"Nothing is written to disk. Opening a file only parses its header and "
"tail, and the entry index is extended lazily as reads move forward."
msgstr "不会写入磁盘。打开文件时只解析文件头与文件尾，entry 索引会随着读取向前推进而增量扩展。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:184 bb4ed5b959c847ec81e98ab3d63402ce
msgid "Close the file when done:"
msgstr "用完后关闭文件："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:191 44a5bcde0c534545ad740a7055ad94fa
msgid "Always close the file after reading to free up system resources."
msgstr "读取后请务必关闭文件，以释放系统资源。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:194 4f805532eaf04137b680dbeaf130ed48
msgid ""
"Open the file using a context manager to automatically close it after "
"reading:"
msgstr "用上下文管理器打开文件，可在读取结束后自动关闭："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:201 4a8e8a2d538c484d915565bad115b920
msgid "Concatenate multiple files"
msgstr "拼接多个文件"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:203 4ef81036d30045f2beea9fc3b294e26f
msgid ""
"To read multiple files and concatenate them into a single array, use "
"`pybes3.concatenate_raw`:"
msgstr "读取多个文件并拼接成单个数组，请使用 `pybes3.concatenate_raw`："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:215 0cc0ac0ff36543d987d323262dbe5160
msgid "Set `verbose=True` to print progress:"
msgstr "设置 `verbose=True` 可打印进度："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:223 142de7948a054e0faa0638ab8691f4f1
msgid ""
"`entry_start`, `entry_stop` and `filter_name` can also be used in "
"`concatenate_raw` to read only a portion of the files or specific fields:"
msgstr ""
"`concatenate_raw` 同样支持 `entry_start`、`entry_stop` 与 "
"`filter_name`，用于只读取部分文件或指定字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:231 e3b3dc3f5c814cd493d05a978478e91c
msgid ""
"Set `workers` to read several files at once. Each worker opens its own "
"reader and keeps its own read buffer of up to 64 MB, so memory grows with"
" the number of workers:"
msgstr ""
"设置 `workers` 可以同时读取多个文件。每个 worker 各自打开一个 reader，并保留"
"自己的读取缓冲区（最大 64 MB），因此内存占用随 worker 数增加："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/data-reading.md:237 7e8b7318164e4b66a4634dd700fbe2f3
msgid ""
"To process several files in batches, use `pybes3.iterate_raw`. "
"`entry_start` and `entry_stop` count entries across all files, and a "
"batch never spans two files:"
msgstr ""
"要在多个文件上分批处理，可使用 `pybes3.iterate_raw`。`entry_start` 与 `entry_stop` "
"按所有文件拼接后的全局 entry 计数，且一批不会跨越两个文件："

